{"displayStem":"두 독립 모형의 배액관은 모두 개통되어 있으며 매일 같은 부피를 배출한다. 그림은 배액 후 잔여 공간의 부피이고 표는 별도 관찰이다. 실제 환자나 배액 속도 권고는 아니다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성 교육용 합성자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 교육용 모식도 · 합성자료","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C04 c04-batch\"><div class=\"evidence C04-vector\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 390\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"자료 38의 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"640\" height=\"390\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><text x=\"65\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">잔여 공간 부피 (mL)</text><path d=\"M75 65L75 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><path d=\"M75 290L580 290\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"190.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">80</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"85.0\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\">160</text><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><text x=\"325.0\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"575.0\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><polyline points=\"75.0,158.75 325.0,132.5 575.0,106.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\"></polyline><circle cx=\"75.0\" cy=\"158.75\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"325.0\" cy=\"132.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"575.0\" cy=\"106.25\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"90\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">공간 A ● 실선</text><polyline points=\"75.0,158.75 325.0,198.125 575.0,237.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 6\"></polyline><circle cx=\"75.0\" cy=\"158.75\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"325.0\" cy=\"198.125\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"575.0\" cy=\"237.5\" r=\"4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"355\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"22\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\">공간 B ○ 점선</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"365\" font-size=\"24\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:Noto Sans CJK KR,sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"middle\">배액 후 시간 (일)</text></g></svg></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C04 c04-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>관찰</th><th>A와 B 공통</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>배액량</td><td>각 30 mL/일</td></tr><tr><td>초기 공간</td><td>각 100 mL</td></tr><tr><td>측정</td><td>동일한 단면분할법으로 1일·2일에 측정</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}